OL,3,GNEWSAHouse fire causes partial roof    
OL,4,Acollapse                               
OL,6,FFirefighters have fought a blaze that  
OL,7,Fcaused the roof of a house to partially
OL,8,Fcollapse.                              
OL,10,FSix fire engines were initially sent to
OL,11,Fthe fire on Athelstan Road in Bitterne,
OL,12,FSouthampton, shortly after 11:00 GMT,  
OL,13,Fwith people living nearby urged to keep
OL,14,Ftheir windows and doors closed due to  
OL,15,Fthe smoke.                             
OL,17,FHampshire & Isle of Wight Fire & Rescue
OL,18,FService said crews had been scaled     
OL,19,Fback, but a road closure would remain  
OL,20,Fin place while firefighters dampen     
OL,21,Fdown.                                  
